  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "It is very important to make it clear in an exposé what the aim of the work is in order to give the reader a precise understanding of the objectives. Your research questions are well and precisely formulated."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
